<div class="mainprocess">
  <h2 class="process-title">9 Steps International Performance Marketing Package for Maximum ROI</h2>
  <div class="roadmap-flow">
    <div class="roadmap-box" data-step="1">
      <h4>Business & Global Goal Understanding</h3>
      <p>Our performance marketing experts first understand your business model, products/services, target countries, audience behavior, and revenue goals. This helps us plan Google Ads and Meta Ads focused on global leads, sales, and measurable growth.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="roadmap-box" data-step="2">
      <h3>International Market & Competitor Research</h3>
      <p>We analyze your global market and international competitors to identify winning ad formats, offers, pricing strategies, and high-performing keywords—so we launch campaigns with a strong, data-backed strategy instead of guesswork.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="roadmap-box" data-step="3">
      <h3>Funnel & Offer Strategy Planning</h3>
      <p>We design optimized ad funnels, landing page journeys, and compelling offers so users from Google or Meta platforms clearly understand the next step and convert smoothly.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="roadmap-box" data-step="4">
      <h3>Audience & Keyword Targeting</h3>
      <p>Our team selects high-intent international audiences on Meta Ads and purchase-ready keywords on Google Ads to reach users who are most likely to enquire or buy.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="roadmap-box" data-step="5">
      <h3>Ad Creatives & Copy Development</h3>
      <p>Our creative team designs engaging ad creatives and writes persuasive ad copies for Google Search, Display, YouTube, and social ads that attract quality global traffic.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="roadmap-box" data-step="6">
      <h3>Campaign & Advanced Tracking Setup</h3>
      <p>We implement proper tracking using Meta Pixel, Google Tag Manager, GA4, and conversion tracking to accurately measure leads, sales, ROAS, and campaign performance.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="roadmap-box" data-step="7">
      <h3>Daily Monitoring & Optimization</h3>
      <p>Campaigns are monitored daily to optimize bids, budgets, keywords, audiences, and creatives—reducing cost per lead and improving overall ROI.

      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="roadmap-box" data-step="8">
      <h3>Testing & Smart Scaling</h3>
      <p>We continuously test new ad creatives, copies, audiences, and keywords. High-performing campaigns are scaled strategically to increase leads or sales without overspending.</p>
